Meaning Banks

Meaning Banks provide the provenance-preserving reserve layer between semantic extraction and semantic muster.

MeaningAccount • MeaningDeposit • MeaningReserve • SemanticDelta • ExchangeRoute • MeaningPacket

```text
QUARRY / OBSERVATION
        ↓
DEPOSIT TRACE + PROVENANCE
        ↓
PRISM / COMPARE
        ↓
DELTA ARROWS + CANDIDATE INVARIANTS
        ↓
BANK / RESERVE
        ↓
TRANS-DICT / EXCHANGE + LOSS AUDIT
        ↓
MUSTER TASK-SPECIFIC MEANING PACKET
        ↓
ACT / TEST
        ↓
AFTERGLOW
        ↓
DEPOSIT USEFUL DELTA
```

Runtime extension:

```text
STRUCTURE
   ↓
SEMANTIC PREFLIGHT
   ├─ continue
   ├─ use_packet
   ├─ prism
   └─ audit
   ↓
ROUTE / MUSTER / FORMATION
```

Canonical invariants:

ACCOUNT ≠ DEFINITION
SURFACE ≠ RESERVE
MEANING ≠ EVIDENCE
EXCHANGE ≠ PRESERVATION unless loss is audited
A DELTA IS AN ARROW, NOT ONLY A BEFORE/AFTER SNAPSHOT

> **Do not merely store definitions; store what lets meaning be reconstructed.**

> **Did the word cross, or did the meaning cross?**